PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  rounded-full pill            → Capsule        ring-1 → .strokeBorder(lineWidth:1)
  bg-{tone}-500/10 + ring/30   → accent.opacity(0.10) background + accent.opacity(0.30) ring   (exact web scale)
  TONE accent                  → live→Color.TS.statusSuccess · reconnecting→Color.TS.statusWarning ·
                                 offline→Color.TS.textMuted   (semantic P1/S9 tokens, light/dark/high-contrast)
  lucide icons                 → Activity→"waveform.path.ecg" · Wifi→"wifi" · WifiOff→"wifi.slash" (SF Symbols)
  animate-pulse (reconnecting) → dot opacity oscillation via TSMotion.slowDuration.repeatForever; suppressed
                                 under Reduce Motion (accessibilityReduceMotion)
  text-xs / font-medium / tabular-nums → Font.TS.caption + .fontWeight(.medium) + .monospacedDigit()
  middot "·"                   → decorative Text, .accessibilityHidden(true)  (web aria-hidden)
  aria-label                   → one combined VoiceOver element (.accessibilityElement(children:.ignore) +
                                 .accessibilityLabel) + .updatesFrequently trait (web role=status/aria-live=polite)
  data-status-live-state       → .accessibilityIdentifier("LiveStatusPill.{state}")  (UI-test marker parity)
  i18n  : LiveStatusStrings (table "LiveStatusPill") with web English fallbacks — P1/S10.
  binding: state + lastUpdateAt arrive via LiveStatusModel/LiveStatusSource — P1/S8; no HTTP in the view.
  telemetry: view.opened surface="LiveStatusPill" emitted exactly once on present — P1/S11.

